      "[회사명] BEARING CO.": "[Company Name] BEARING CO.",
      "\n          사업자등록번호 000-00-00000 · 대표 홍길동<br>\n          비공개 (문의 시 안내드립니다)\n        ": "\n          Business Registration No. 000-00-00000 · CEO Hong Gil-dong<br>\n          Not disclosed (available upon inquiry)\n        ",
      "\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">회사소개</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">취급제품</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">문의</a>\n      ": "\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">Company</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">Products</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">Contact</a>\n      ",
      "\n        ※ 위 UC·UK 인서트용 하우징 표는 SWS 카탈로그에 없어 JIB(제일베어링) 공식 카탈로그(하우징 치수표, B01/B07/B08/B09/B10/B11/B17/B19/B25/B26/B27/B28/B32/B34/B40/B42/B46/B47/B48/B49 섹션)를 기준으로 작성했습니다. 하우징은 여러 축경을 하나의 규격으로 겸용하는 경우가 많아, 겸용되는 축경 범위를 “적용 축경”으로 표시했습니다. H·L 외의 세부 치수(J·F·볼트 규격 등)는 정식 도면으로 별도 안내드리며, 구면 롤러 베어링용 SN 하우징은 <a href=\"plummer_block.html\">플러머 블럭</a> 페이지를 참고해 주세요. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 견적 문의로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.\n      ": "\n        * The above housing tables for UC/UK insert bearings are not found in the SWS catalog, so they were compiled based on the official JIB (Jeil Bearing) catalog (housing dimension tables, sections B01/B07/B08/B09/B10/B11/B17/B19/B25/B26/B27/B28/B32/B34/B40/B42/B46/B47/B48/B49). Since a single housing specification often covers multiple shaft diameters, the range of shaft diameters it covers is shown as \"Applicable Shaft Dia.\" Detailed dimensions other than H/L (such as J, F, bolt specifications, etc.) are provided separately via official drawings; for SN housings used with spherical roller bearings, please refer to the <a href=\"plummer_block.html\">Plummer Block</a> page. Before precision machining or ordering, please always make a final confirmation via a quote inquiry.\n      ",
      "형번": "Model Number",
      "적용 축경(mm)": "Applicable Shaft Dia. (mm)",
      "H(중심높이)": "H (Center Height)",
      "L(전장)": "L (Overall Length)",
      "중량(kg)": "Weight (kg)",
      "\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Unit Case (Housing) · T Type</p>\n        <h2>유닛 케이스 — T형 (테이크업)</h2>\n        <p>UC(내경 표준)·UK(테이퍼 내경) 베어링을 원통형 테이크업 하우징에 일체화한 유닛입니다. 레일을 따라 위치 조정이 가능해 체인·벨트 장력 조절 등에 사용됩니다.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>\n      ": "\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Unit Case (Housing) · T Type</p>\n        <h2>Unit Housing — T Type (Take-Up)</h2>\n        <p>A unit that integrates UC (standard bore) and UK (tapered bore) bearings into a cylindrical take-up housing. It can be repositioned along a rail, making it useful for chain/belt tension adjustment, among other uses.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>\n      ",
      "\n          <p class=\"diagram-caption\">JIB 카탈로그 규격 도면</p>\n          <img src=\"img/plb_diagram.webp\" alt=\"테이크업형 유닛 구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ UCT 테이크업 하우징 단면도 · H(중심높이)·L(조정 슬롯 포함 전장)</p>\n        ": "\n          <p class=\"diagram-caption\">JIB Catalog Standard Drawing</p>\n          <img src=\"img/plb_diagram.webp\" alt=\"Take-up type unit structural cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ UCT Take-Up Housing Cross-Section Diagram · H (Center Height) · L (Overall Length, Including Adjustment Slot)</p>\n        ",
      "\n          <label for=\"tuFilter\">형번 / 축경 검색</label>\n          <input id=\"tuFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: UCT201 또는 30\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ": "\n          <label for=\"tuFilter\">Search by Model / Shaft Dia.</label>\n          <input id=\"tuFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. UCT201 or 30\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ",
      "\n          <p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"tuCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"tuToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>\n        ": "\n          <p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"tuCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"tuToggleAll\">Expand All</button>\n        ",
